OL,3,AOfcom investigates Meta over Instagram
OL,4,AInstants feature
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Meta spokesperson said in a statement
OL,7,Fthat it "takes its regulatory
OL,8,Fobligations under the Online Safety Act
OL,9,Fseriously".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
