OL,3,ARosie O'Donnell and Julie Hesmondhalgh
OL,4,Ato appear in play about Gisele Pelicot
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS comedian Rosie O'Donnell, Celebrity
OL,8,FTraitors star Julie Hesmondhalgh,
OL,9,FBridgerton's Adjoa Andoh and EastEnders
OL,10,Factress Tamzin Outhwaite will appear in
OL,11,Fa play based on the trial of the
OL,12,Fhusband of Gisele Pelicot.
OL,14,FThirty actors and public figures will
OL,15,Ftake part in The Pelicot Trial, a
OL,16,Fone-off "documentary theatre" style
OL,17,Fperformance at London's County Hall
OL,18,Fnext month.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
